msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/simulate-neutron-scattering/extracted-outputs/e78f8d9a-1.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Execute using Qiskit primitives {#step-3-execute-using-qiskit-primitives}"
msgstr "Langkah 3: Mengeksekusi menggunakan primitive Qiskit {#step-3-execute-using-qiskit-primitives}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We simulate each AQC-compiled circuit using the `StatevectorEstimator` primitive.\n"
msgstr "Kita mensimulasikan setiap circuit yang dikompilasi AQC menggunakan primitive `StatevectorEstimator`.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Post-process and return result in desired classical format {#step-4-post-process-and-return-result-in-desired-classical-format}"
msgstr "Langkah 4: Pasca-pemrosesan dan mengembalikan hasil dalam format klasik yang diinginkan {#step-4-post-process-and-return-result-in-desired-classical-format}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We now extract the expectation value $\\langle\\sigma_i^z\\rangle$ for every qubit $i$ at each time step $t$. These values form the retarded Green's function matrix $G^R(j, j_c, t)$. Then, we Fourier-transform the RGF into the dynamical structure factor $S(q, \\omega)$ and plot both the RGF and the DSF. `get_dsf` applies mirror symmetry and clips negative values internally.\n"
msgstr "Sekarang kita mengekstrak nilai ekspektasi $\\langle\\sigma_i^z\\rangle$ untuk setiap qubit $i$ pada setiap langkah waktu $t$. Nilai-nilai ini membentuk matriks fungsi Green tertunda $G^R(j, j_c, t)$. Kemudian, kita melakukan transformasi Fourier RGF menjadi faktor struktur dinamis $S(q, \\omega)$ dan memplot baik RGF maupun DSF. `get_dsf` menerapkan simetri cermin dan memotong nilai negatif secara internal.\n"

